INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`, `Emote1`, `Emote2`, `Emote3`, `Emote4`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `EmoteDelay4`, `RewardText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Thank you, $R. Four years ago my commanding officer ordered me to escort a caravan of villagers out of Lordaeron. I remained with them as they settled here and built Hawk\'s Vigil. Arthas himself had returned to Lordaeron to lead the genocide of his own people.$B$BMany perished to give us a chance to escape, Jennalla among them. With the incense produced from the Auriblooms, we honor their memory.', 0),
(40566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh perfect, thank you! This should teach him a lesson. here\'s your silver, now shoo!', 0),
(40567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Poison? Wow, this complicates things greatly. We may need to take a more direct approach.', 0),
(40568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'From Hawk\'s Vigil? What a juicy predicament indeed!$B$B<He trails off into a quiet, throaty laughter.>', 0),
(40569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Well well, look at those beautifully tainted hearts. Perfect. You have done me a great service today, $R. Here... When you feel strong enough, take one of my special creations, a token of thanks.', 0),
(40570, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'This? This will do what I think it will, yes? Then I think I have one more thing to ask of you, $C.', 0),
(40571, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'By the light, what is that! This is what tormented me for months? I... I think I remember those eyes, yes.$B$BAs much as it pains me to do so, I must show this to Rose. There is no other way to prove what she means to me, that I would never do what she thinks I did!$B$BAnd your name, friend? Ah, thank you $N.', 0),
(40682, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Razormaw no match for $N, you strong-strong, and quick-quick, one day Dagdag be like you.', 0),
(41750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<You don\'t have much time to react as you hand Grimbite the head of Gowlfang. With untamed wrath and hate, the gnoll tears the head out of your hand, before viciously biting into it, ravaging it into an unrecognizable state. After he is done, he tosses what is left into the near bog, letting it sink to the ground of the swamp. A yowling scream escapes Grimbite\'s jaw, the other gnolls follow suit. The howling persists for a few moments, echoing throughout all of the Wetlands.>$B$BGowlfang is dead! Mosshide now truly free! You member of Mosshide, forever. Take this, for killing Betrayer.', 0),
(41751, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'It is done. Life and death is a cycle that has to be maintained, and tainted life must be given the chance to bloom once more. The pain in my heart will continue to ache, yet I can be assured that Searistrasz is no longer in torment. Go in peace, mortal, and may your travels be without tragedy.', 0),
(41785, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Nydiszanz recoils and hisses in pain at the sight of the Demon Soul shard. Just being near it causes a visceral reaction by him.>$B$BImpossible, you retrieved it and dare bring it to us?! I don’t know if you are reckless, cruel, gullible or all of the above. But... you being here... with it... It means the Dragonmaw are no more. Their warchief returned to the cycle, their machinations thwarted. And the Demon Soul returned to us. Even through all its taint, I can sense the Queen’s benevolence somewhere hidden within, reaching out...$B$B$N, hand me the shard and I will deliver it to our Queen. Only she is capable of destroying the last remnants from this dark hour of our past. For you, I present these. A just reward for your sacrifice in stopping the Dragonmaw and ending the terror of the Demon Soul. Use it well, mortal.', 0),
(55100, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Is Menethil Harbor still in the dark about what has happened here?$B$BI need proof to report to that fool Grovug stationed in the mountains. You\'ll help right?', 0),
(55101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You\'re saying these are from the Whelgar site? Really?$B$BI thought they were all overreacting down there, but if it\'s as bad as you say then I\'m going to have to write a report and get it to Ironforge as quickly as I can!', 0),
(55200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Quicker than I had imagined! You must be a seasoned explorer. Hopefully one day I will see as much as you have. Thanks, $N.', 0),
(55201, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Less raptors stalking at the base of our hills puts my mind to rest. Thanks for the work, $N.', 0),
(55202, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Cousin Hargin finally coughin up the good stuff, aye?! Well, it\'s about damn time! If this stuff is as good as he says it may not last the night! For your troubles...$B$B<Hands over some coins.>$B$BIf you\'re lookin for more ways to make some coin, talk to Samuel in Hawk\'s Vigil. He\'s an adventurer of sorts and could likely use a hand.', 0),
(55203, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I figured the shipment would come late. Given all of the trouble on the road east of here, it seems Hawk\'s Vigil has remained reliable in their shipments.', 0),
(55204, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'From Captain Stoutfist, huh? Let\'s see here...$B$B<The Dwarf reads the report.>$B$BHe thinks the few mountaineers I have can stop the Dragonmaw?', 0),
(55205, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'He cannot even lend a single hand to assist us? What is it then we are supposed to do against the Dragonmaw?...$B$BThanks, $N. Take these coins for the trouble. I will have to think of a new plan.', 0),
(55206, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You\'ve done it!$B$BWe may finally sleep a night of peace knowing there are less of the blackbloods stalking the hills and preying upon our citizens. You have done a noble deed, $N.', 0),
(55207, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, Rann sent you? Surely, he didn\'t just ramble on about my pie!', 0),
(55208, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Pie pie pie! My, oh my!$B$BI\'ve been dreaming of this for days!', 0),
(55209, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, that Fradd. Look at all these new gadgets and gizmos! Wizzing Fraddbangers, Shocking Gynochroms, Tilting Oscillation Inhibitors?!$B$BThis is all state of the art stuff, thanks for the delivery, take this for the trip.', 0),
(55210, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'You\'ve got it all?$B$BSplendid! Now I can get to work tinkering for you so that I can get to use my own!', 0),
(55211, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Here it is, my creation!$B$BAn engineering masterpiece.$B$BMay it serve you well out there, now, on to my own works!', 0),
(55212, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, Barthos sent you? He\'s always looking for supplies. He\'s lucky to have saved my hide in the past. I still owe him for that!', 0),
(55213, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, Orion! What a friend, he always comes in clutch right at the perfect time!$B$BI was on my last few sputtercogs! What do you mean by job at Ironforge Airport?$B$BWhy would I want to do that when I can tinker here in my own shop!', 0),
(55215, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'I have spent quite some time researching into what is going on, something lingers within the air, as if the presence of forbidden magic is being introduced to Hawk\'s Vigil.', 0),
(55216, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, Marge Blackwood sent you, the matter of the dark magic in Hawk\'s Vigil? I see.', 0),
(55217, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm.. So he believes that perhaps this source could be new to the region?$B$BI haven\'t thought of that as a possibility.', 0),
(55218, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Interesting report, let me check my records and make sure about the new people within the town.', 0),
(55219, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh...$B$B<Robb Dursley\'s cheerful demeanor drops.>$B$BThat is why you\'ve come?$B$BWhat we are going to speak of must remain a secret, understood, $N?', 0),
(55220, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<Mathias takes the Report and begins to read.>$B$BHmm, I suspected as much, the man was deranged and lost within such magic, it only makes sense he would be behind this \'foul taint\' as Lord Commander Ryke has described it.', 0),
(55221, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Excellent. Now, let us see truly where this man is from. Perhaps we can find some clues on all of this.', 0),
(55222, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Oh, I haven\'t heard the name Martin Corinth before, but I do remember a Harlus Ashbuckle, what about them?', 0),
(55223, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Hmm, so, he did leave stuff within Menethil, it seems the man didn\'t cover all of his tracks, thankfully for us.', 0),
(55224, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'So, our suspicions here were correct then, there is a lot of information here that is damning.', 0),
(55225, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The town has been saved! I thank you again $N. Hawk\'s Vigil shall remain a place of peace as long as brave souls like yourself walk Azeroth.$B$BHere, take one of these as a token of the town\'s gratitude.', 0);
INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` (`ID`, `EmoteOnComplete`, `EmoteOnIncomplete`, `CompletionText`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(40368, 0, 0, 'Is it done, $R? The Auribloom should not be too difficult to find.', 0),
(40566, 0, 0, 'Have you got what I need, or are you just being nosy?', 0),
(40567, 0, 0, 'Can I help you?', 0),
(40568, 0, 0, 'Hmm?', 0),
(40569, 0, 0, 'Have you given up yet?', 0),
(40570, 0, 0, 'You have returned! What news do you bring?', 0),
(40571, 0, 0, 'I haven\'t slept a wink. Not only with this damn evil presence, but my wife kicked me out the house too!', 0),
(40682, 0, 0, 'Razormaw strong, they kill-kill quick, you must be quick-quick too!', 0),
(41750, 0, 0, 'Where is the head?! Head of Betrayer?!', 0),
(41751, 0, 0, 'Even years later, the foul shadow of the Demon Soul haunts our flight.', 0),
(41785, 0, 0, 'This aura...! It cannot be!', 0),
(55100, 0, 0, 'Yeah, can I help you? Things are a bit of a mess here.', 0),
(55101, 0, 0, 'I\'m on important League business up here.', 0),
(55200, 0, 0, 'Have you had a chance to gather the materials for my adventure?', 0),
(55201, 0, 0, 'Have you slain some of the beasts blocking our path?', 0),
(55202, 0, 0, 'Aye, is there something you need?', 0),
(55203, 0, 0, 'Yes, do you have anything for me? I am currently quite busy.', 0),
(55204, 0, 0, 'We must keep resolute, though we are in the mountains, we are still dependant to those on the ground to keep supplies moving.', 0),
(55205, 0, 0, 'Have you got word from Snowbeard? Are fresh men coming?', 0),
(55206, 0, 0, 'The Dragonmaw must be checked at every instance, lest they gain more courage in their actions.', 0),
(55207, 0, 0, 'Hello there, traveler. Welcome to my inn!', 0),
(55208, 0, 0, 'You\'re back this soon? You better have my pie!', 0),
(55209, 0, 0, 'Oh, are you here for something, or you just looking to chat about some of my new inventions?', 0),
(55210, 0, 0, 'Have you gathered the materials?!$B$BMy mind is going wild with ideas!', 0),
(55211, 0, 0, 'One moment, lad. I\'m tinkering!', 0),
(55212, 0, 0, 'Welcome to the Airfield! Do you have any business with the senate, or our operations here?', 0),
(55213, 0, 0, 'Have you got those parts from the Airfield I sent you for?', 0),
(55215, 0, 0, 'Is there something I can do for you?', 0),
(55216, 0, 0, 'There is much knowledge to learn, is that why you have come to seek my presence?', 0),
(55217, 0, 0, 'You return from Poppy Zabini?', 0),
(55218, 0, 0, 'Welcome back, has Marge got any news on all of the trouble?', 0),
(55219, 0, 0, 'What would Lord Commander Ryke have to do with me?', 0),
(55220, 0, 0, 'What is it you require from the SI:7?', 0),
(55221, 0, 0, 'Have you braved the depths of the Stockades yet?', 0),
(55222, 0, 0, 'Hello, and welcome to my tavern, looking for a room?', 0),
(55223, 0, 0, 'Have you got any news from Menethil?', 0),
(55224, 0, 0, 'So, you\'ve returned, good news from Stormwind?', 0),
(55225, 0, 0, 'Has this monster been dealt with?', 0);
